cing changes on April 15, 2021.</li>\n<li>Its experience was further reduced from 21,450 to 18,870 with the changes on June 01, 2021.</li>\n<li>Its experience was increased from 18,870 to 21,130 with the balancing changes on Aug 05, 2026.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,586 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Crystal Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Coin_55f849.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.56</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"55.989912\" style=\"text-align:center;\">56%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Great Mana Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Mana_Potion_d7fd8c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-3</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"50.126103\" style=\"text-align:center;\">50%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i